        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88STPH, 88 Series Solid Brass Single Roll Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in either satin nickel or polished chrome finishes, the 88 Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The sleek, modern look will look great in any contemporary decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88STPH-specifications.gif?v=1704354570\" width=\"594\" height=\"219\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88STPH Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass Single Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88STPH.pdf?v=1691095351\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88STPH Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
